    <briefdescription>
<para>The error handling API supports checking the error status of PDI. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, errors in PDI C API are signaled by a return code of type PDI_status_t and an error message can be retrieved with the PDI_errmsg function. This default behavior can be changed by replacing the error handler with the PDI_errhandler function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
